@deffn Command vm-mail-mode-comment-region beg end &optional arg
@findex vm-mail-mode-comment-region
Comment or uncomment each line in the region BEG to END.
With just a non-nil prefix ARG, uncomment each line in region.
Numeric prefix arg ARG means use ARG comment characters.
If ARG is negative, delete that many comment characters instead.
Comments are terminated on each line, even for syntax in which newline does
not end the comment.  Blank lines do not get comments.
@end deffn

@deffn Command vm-mail-mode-elide-reply-region b e
@findex vm-mail-mode-elide-reply-region
Replace marked region or current line with @code{vm-mail-mode-elide-reply-region}.
