@end deffn

@deffn Command vm-mail-subject-cleanup
@findex vm-mail-subject-cleanup
Do some subject line clean up.
- Replace subject prefixes according to @code{vm-mail-subject-prefix-replacements}.
- Add a number after replies is @code{vm-mail-subject-number-reply} is t.

You might add this function to @code{vm-mail-mode-hook} in order to clean up the
Subject header.
@end deffn

