@end defopt

@defopt vm-pgg-cleartext-search-limit
@vindex vm-pgg-cleartext-search-limit
Number of bytes to peek into the message for a PGP clear text armor.

Default value: @code{4096}
@end defopt

@defopt vm-pgg-fetch-missing-keys
@vindex vm-pgg-fetch-missing-keys
If t, PGP will try to fetch missing keys from @code{pgg-default-keyserver-address}.

Default value: @code{t}
@end defopt

@defopt vm-pgg-get-author-headers
@vindex vm-pgg-get-author-headers
The list of headers to get the author of a mail that is to be sent.
If nil, @code{pgg-default-user-id} is used as a fallback.

