@end defopt

@defopt vm-highlighted-header-face
@vindex vm-highlighted-header-face
Face to be used to highlight headers.
The headers to highlight are specified by the @code{vm-highlighted-header-regexp}
variable.

This variable is ignored under XEmacs if @code{vm-use-lucid-highlighting} is
non-nil.  XEmacs’ highlight-headers package is used instead.  See the
documentation for the function @code{highlight-headers} to find out how to
customize header highlighting using this package.

Default value: @code{vm-highlighted-header}
@end defopt

@defopt vm-mime-button-face
@vindex vm-mime-button-face
Face used for text in buttons that trigger the display of MIME objects.

Default value: @code{vm-mime-button}
@end defopt

@defopt vm-mime-button-mouse-face
