@deffn Command vm-mime-rename-attachment
@findex vm-mime-rename-attachment
Give the attachment at point a different file name.
The name is the one the recipient sees, and the one their mailer will
suggest when they save it; the file the attachment was read from is not
touched.
@end deffn

@deffn Command vm-mime-run-display-function-at-point &optional function
@findex vm-mime-run-display-function-at-point
Run the @code{vm-mime-function} for the MIME button at point.
If optional argument FUNCTION is given, run it instead.
					          USR, 2011-03-07
@end deffn

@deffn Command vm-nuke-alternative-text/html &optional count mlist
@findex vm-nuke-alternative-text/html
Removes the text/html part of all multipart/alternative message parts.

This is a destructive operation and cannot be undone!
@end deffn

