@defopt vm-biff-mode-hook
@vindex vm-biff-mode-hook
Hook run after entering or leaving @code{vm-biff-mode}.
No problems result if this variable is not bound.
@code{add-hook} automatically binds it.  (This is true for all hook variables.)
@end defopt

@defopt vm-biff-place-frame-function
@vindex vm-biff-place-frame-function
Function that sets the popup frame position and size.

Default value: @code{vm-biff-place-frame}
@end defopt

@defopt vm-biff-position
@vindex vm-biff-position
Position of the popup-frame.

Default value: @code{center}
@end defopt

@defopt vm-biff-select-frame-hook
@vindex vm-biff-select-frame-hook
List of hook functions to be run when selection a message.
You may want to add @code{vm-biff-fvwm-focus-vm-folder-frame}.
@end defopt

@defopt vm-biff-select-hook
