List of hook functions to be run when selection a message.
@end defopt

@defopt vm-biff-selector
@vindex vm-biff-selector
Virtual folder selector matching the messages the pop-up shows.

Default value: @code{(and (new) (not (deleted)) (not (outgoing)))}
@end defopt

@defopt vm-biff-summary-format
@vindex vm-biff-summary-format
Like @code{vm-summary-format} but for popup buffers.
@end defopt

@defopt vm-biff-width
